"""
EffectsTab — 鬼畜特效标签页
分类树 + 已添加特效列表 + 参数面板 + 预览
【开发状态：已完成】
"""

from PyQt6.QtWidgets import (
    QWidget, QVBoxLayout, QHBoxLayout, QLabel, QPushButton,
    QListWidget, QListWidgetItem, QTreeWidget, QTreeWidgetItem,
    QScrollArea, QSplitter, QAbstractItemView,
)
from PyQt6.QtCore import Qt, pyqtSignal
from app.theme import COLORS
from app.effects.base import BaseEffect, EffectParam
from app.effects.registry import EffectRegistry
from app.effects.pipeline import EffectPipeline


class EffectsTab(QWidget):
    """特效管理标签页"""

    pipeline_changed = pyqtSignal()

    def __init__(self, parent=None):
        super().__init__(parent)
        self._pipeline = EffectPipeline(self)
        self._pipeline.effects_changed.connect(lambda: self.pipeline_changed.emit())
        self._init_ui()

    def _init_ui(self):
        root = QVBoxLayout(self)
        root.setContentsMargins(20, 16, 20, 16)
        root.setSpacing(12)

        title = QLabel("✦ 鬼畜特效")
        title.setStyleSheet(f"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: {COLORS['text_primary']};")
        root.addWidget(title)

        splitter = QSplitter(Qt.Orientation.Horizontal)

        # --- 左侧：特效目录 ---
        left = QWidget()
        left_layout = QVBoxLayout(left)
        left_layout.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 8, 0)

        left_layout.addWidget(QLabel("特效目录"))
        self._tree = QTreeWidget()
        self._tree.setHeaderHidden(True)
        self._tree.setDragEnabled(True)
        self._tree.itemDoubleClicked.connect(self._add_effect)
        self._populate_tree()
        left_layout.addWidget(self._tree)

        splitter.addWidget(left)

        # --- 中间：已添加特效 ---
        mid = QWidget()
        mid_layout = QVBoxLayout(mid)
        mid_layout.setContentsMargins(8, 0, 8, 0)

        mid_layout.addWidget(QLabel(f"已添加特效 ({len(self._pipeline)})"))
        self._effect_list = QListWidget()
        self._effect_list.setDragDropMode(QAbstractItemView.DragDropMode.InternalMove)
        self._effect_list.setSelectionMode(QAbstractItemView.SelectionMode.SingleSelection)
        self._effect_list.itemClicked.connect(self._on_select)
        self._effect_list.model().rowsMoved.connect(self._on_reorder)
        mid_layout.addWidget(self._effect_list)

        btns = QHBoxLayout()
        up_btn = QPushButton("↑ 上移")
        up_btn.clicked.connect(lambda: self._move_effect(-1))
        btns.addWidget(up_btn)
        dn_btn = QPushButton("↓ 下移")
        dn_btn.clicked.connect(lambda: self._move_effect(1))
        btns.addWidget(dn_btn)
        rm_btn = QPushButton("✕ 移除")
        rm_btn.setProperty("class", "danger")
        rm_btn.clicked.connect(self._remove_effect)
        btns.addWidget(rm_btn)
        mid_layout.addLayout(btns)

        splitter.addWidget(mid)

        # --- 右侧：参数面板 ---
        right = QWidget()
        right_layout = QVBoxLayout(right)
        right_layout.setContentsMargins(8, 0, 0, 0)

        right_layout.addWidget(QLabel("特效参数"))
        self._params_area = QScrollArea()
        self._params_area.setWidgetResizable(True)
        self._params_widget = QWidget()
        self._params_layout = QVBoxLayout(self._params_widget)
        self._params_layout.setAlignment(Qt.AlignmentFlag.AlignTop)
        self._params_area.setWidget(self._params_widget)
        right_layout.addWidget(self._params_area)

        splitter.addWidget(right)

        splitter.setSizes([250, 300, 350])
        root.addWidget(splitter, 1)

    # ---- 目录树 ----
    def _populate_tree(self):
        """填充特效分类树"""
        # 导入所有特效模块以触发注册
        from app.effects import time, spatial, color, blur_noise, overlay, keying, audio, combo  # noqa: F401
        cats = EffectRegistry.all_categories()
        for cat, names in sorted(cats.items()):
            cat_item = QTreeWidgetItem([cat])
            cat_item.setFlags(cat_item.flags() & ~Qt.ItemFlag.ItemIsDragEnabled)
            for name in sorted(names):
                eff_cls = EffectRegistry.get(name)
                desc = eff_cls.description if eff_cls else ""
                child = QTreeWidgetItem([f"{name}", desc])
                child.setData(0, Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, name)
                cat_item.addChild(child)
            self._tree.addTopLevelItem(cat_item)
        self._tree.expandAll()

    # ---- 特效操作 ----
    def _add_effect(self, item: QTreeWidgetItem, col: int):
        name = item.data(0, Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole)
        if not name:
            return
        eff = EffectRegistry.instantiate(name)
        if eff:
            self._pipeline.add(eff)
            self._refresh_list()

    def _remove_effect(self):
        row = self._effect_list.currentRow()
        if row >= 0:
            self._pipeline.remove(row)
            self._refresh_list()

    def _move_effect(self, delta: int):
        row = self._effect_list.currentRow()
        new_row = row + delta
        if 0 <= row < len(self._pipeline) and 0 <= new_row < len(self._pipeline):
            self._pipeline.move(row, new_row)
            self._refresh_list()
            self._effect_list.setCurrentRow(new_row)

    def _on_reorder(self):
        """拖拽排序后的处理"""
        items = []
        for i in range(self._effect_list.count()):
            items.append(self._effect_list.item(i).data(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole))
        for i, effect in enumerate(items):
            if self._pipeline[i] is not effect:
                self._pipeline.move(self._pipeline._effects.index(effect), i)
        self._refresh_params()

    def _on_select(self, item: QListWidgetItem):
        idx = self._effect_list.row(item)
        if 0 <= idx < len(self._pipeline):
            self._show_params(idx)

    def _refresh_list(self):
        """刷新已添加特效列表"""
        self._effect_list.clear()
        for i, eff in enumerate(self._pipeline):
            text = f"{'✅' if eff.enabled else '❌'} {eff.name}"
            item = QListWidgetItem(text)
            item.setData(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, eff)
            self._effect_list.addItem(item)

    def _show_params(self, idx: int):
        """显示指定特效的参数面板"""
        # 清除旧控件
        while self._params_layout.count():
            child = self._params_layout.takeAt(0)
            if child.widget():
                child.widget().deleteLater()

        if idx < 0 or idx >= len(self._pipeline):
            return

        effect = self._pipeline[idx]

        # 启用/禁用复选框
        from PyQt6.QtWidgets import QCheckBox
        cb = QCheckBox("启用此特效")
        cb.setChecked(effect.enabled)
        cb.toggled.connect(lambda v: self._pipeline.toggle(idx, v) or self._refresh_list())
        self._params_layout.addWidget(cb)

        for p in effect.get_param_defs():
            lbl = QLabel(f"{p.label}:")
            lbl.setStyleSheet(f"color: {COLORS['text_secondary']}; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px;")
            self._params_layout.addWidget(lbl)

            if p.options:
                from PyQt6.QtWidgets import QComboBox
                w = QComboBox()
                for val, lab in p.options:
                    w.addItem(lab, val)
                w.setCurrentIndex(max(0, [o[0] for o in p.options].index(effect.get_param(p.name))))
                w.currentIndexChanged.connect(
                    lambda i, n=p.name, opts=p.options: effect.set_param(n, opts[i][0]) or self.pipeline_changed.emit()
                )
                self._params_layout.addWidget(w)
            elif p.param_type is float:
                from PyQt6.QtWidgets import QDoubleSpinBox
                w = QDoubleSpinBox()
                if p.min_val is not None: w.setRange(p.min_val, p.max_val or 100)
                if p.step: w.setSingleStep(p.step)
                w.setValue(effect.get_param(p.name) or 0)
                if p.suffix: w.setSuffix(f" {p.suffix}")
                w.valueChanged.connect(lambda v, n=p.name: effect.set_param(n, v) or self.pipeline_changed.emit())
                self._params_layout.addWidget(w)
            elif p.param_type is int:
                from PyQt6.QtWidgets import QSpinBox
                w = QSpinBox()
                if p.min_val is not None: w.setRange(int(p.min_val), int(p.max_val or 100))
                w.setValue(effect.get_param(p.name) or 0)
                if p.suffix: w.setSuffix(f" {p.suffix}")
                w.valueChanged.connect(lambda v, n=p.name: effect.set_param(n, v) or self.pipeline_changed.emit())
                self._params_layout.addWidget(w)
            elif p.param_type is str:
                from PyQt6.QtWidgets import QLineEdit
                w = QLineEdit(str(effect.get_param(p.name) or ""))
                w.textChanged.connect(lambda v, n=p.name: effect.set_param(n, v) or self.pipeline_changed.emit())
                self._params_layout.addWidget(w)

    def _refresh_params(self):
        row = self._effect_list.currentRow()
        if row >= 0:
            self._show_params(row)

    # ---- 公开 ----
    def get_pipeline(self) -> EffectPipeline:
        return self._pipeline
